=== A.6 Aristotelian definitions ===
ex:TrainJourney
    skos:definition "A train journey is a service that is operated by exactly one train and connects a start station to an end station."@en .

ex:Train
    skos:definition "A train is a piece of equipment that operates train journeys and consists of one or more coaches."@en .

ex:Coach
    skos:definition "A coach is a piece of equipment that forms part of a train."@en .